CaImAn-main/

# ── Tuning / validation run outputs (never commit) ───────────────────────────
# tune.py / validate_session.py / batch_tune.py write timestamped run folders
# (report.md, report.html, *.png, recommended_params.json, comparison.md, +
# multi-GB mc.zarr / Y_flat scratch). The *.zarr/*.npy rules above already drop
# the big binaries; these drop the trackable text/figure leftovers so a stray
# `git add -A` can never pull a run tree into the repo. Directory rules (not
# by-name) so a deliberate reference example under examples/ stays trackable.
runs/
tuning/tune_*/
live_runs/tuning_*/
live_runs/diagnostics_figs/
**/full/
**/batch_summary.md

# MkDocs build output
site/

# ── Local dev / AI-assistant context (not part of the public package) ─────────
# Kept on disk locally for development; never published.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
todo/
live_runs/
